      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is a good incentive to keep pushing for font access in the GPU process ;) so the remote glyph cache can go away entirely. I am not familiar with the protocol for keeping this cache in sync, but it seems best if we can avoid triggering a full context loss (I think that would hurt all renderer processes if we have to restart the GPU process). However, if the client can detect this and reset it\u0027s client-side state and handles, that seems acceptable since only the one renderer process would be impacted.",
